{"text":{"en":{"요오크형 트랙 롤러 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"Yoke Type Track Roller Bearings | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Yoke Type Track Roller Bearings</p> <h2>요오크형 트랙 롤러 베어링</h2> <p>복열 니들 롤러(NUTR)와 케이지형(NATR) 구조로 큰 반경 방향 하중과 충격 하중을 지지하며, LR 시리즈(단열/복열 볼 트랙 롤러)도 함께 제공합니다.</p> <p>캠 기구, 컨베이어, 자동화 설비의 가이드 롤러로 사용됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Yoke Type Track Roller Bearings</p> <h2>Yoke Type Track Roller Bearings</h2> <p>With a double-row needle roller (NUTR) and caged (NATR) structure, these support large radial loads and shock loads. The LR series (single-/double-row ball track rollers) is also available.</p> <p>Used as guide rollers in cam mechanisms, conveyors, and automation equipment.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just the part number or part of the dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/yoke_track_roller.webp\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 185px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Standard Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/yoke_track_roller.webp\" alt=\"Cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 185px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(bore) · D(O.D.) · Tolerance(d/D) · B(width)</p>","<label for=\"ytrFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"ytrFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: NUTR 2047R 또는 20*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"ytrFilter\">Part Number / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"ytrFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. NUTR 2047R or 20*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"ytrCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" c